OL,3,CEngland flags banned after council
OL,4,Cwins court case
OL,6,FOxfordshire County Council (OCC) has
OL,7,Fbeen granted a High Court injunction
OL,8,Fto stop unknown people from placing
OL,9,Fflags on lampposts.
OL,11,FOCC launched legal action to stop
OL,12,Fpeople raising flags near highways,
OL,13,Fwhich it said involved safety risks,
OL,14,Fas well as trespass and obstruction.
OL,16,FBreach of the injunction could lead to
OL,17,Fseizures of assets, unlimited fines or
OL,18,Fimprisonment.
