OL,3,CEngland flags banned after council
OL,4,Cwins court case
OL,6,FThe widespread flying of Union and St
OL,7,FGeorge's Cross flags, following an
OL,8,Fonline campaign called Operation Raise
OL,9,FThe Colours, has become contentious
OL,10,Fand several local authorities have
OL,11,Fremoved them from public
OL,12,Finfrastructure.
OL,14,FWhile some politicians decried the
OL,15,Fremovals, others claimed the increased
OL,16,Fnumber being flown was a result of
OL,17,Fxenophobia or racism.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
