FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785514721
OL,3,CEngland flags banned after council
OL,4,Cwins court case
OL,6,FOxfordshire County Council said flags
OL,7,Fhad been placed on or near public
OL,8,Froads without permission for months,
OL,9,Fdespite a formal legal notice in March
OL,10,Fand pre-action legal letters sent to
OL,11,Findividuals in May.
OL,13,FThe injunction also prevents unknown
OL,14,Fpeople from painting flags on roads in
OL,15,FOxfordshire.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
