OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785514721
OL,3,CEngland flags banned after council
OL,4,Cwins court case
OL,6,FIn his judgment, Mr Justice Dexter
OL,7,FDias said: "The motivation for the
OL,8,Fclaimant's application against persons
OL,9,Funknown is that a significant body of
OL,10,Fparticipants in the affixing of flags
OL,11,Fin Oxfordshire remains unidentified at
OL,12,Fthe time of the applications, and
OL,13,Findeed at the hearings before the
OL,14,Fcourt."
OL,16,F"Although the claimant has repeatedly
OL,17,Fremoved unauthorised flags, more flags
OL,18,Fare later affixed.
OL,26,@oD@LOUvD@GO]xD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
