PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785514721
OL,3,CEngland flags banned after council
OL,4,Cwins court case
OL,6,F"People directed by the claimant,
OL,7,Fwhether council employees or
OL,8,Fcontractors, have been obstructed in
OL,9,Fthe execution of their removal duties,
OL,10,Fto the extent that at times they have
OL,11,Fsimply given up on the removal."
OL,13,FThe judge said that workers have faced
OL,14,Fabuse or intimidation while taking
OL,15,Fflags down, as well as residents.
OL,17,FHe added that maintenance teams have
OL,18,Fbeen "working in fear", are told to
OL,19,Fwear face coverings and have had to
OL,20,Fcheck vehicles for tracking tags after
OL,21,Fa worker's home address was published.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@`O]zD@FOUzD@VO]
