OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785514721
OL,3,CEngland flags banned after council
OL,4,Cwins court case
OL,6,FMr Justice Dexter Dias said: "The
OL,7,Faffixing of flags and the painting of
OL,8,Finsignia on the highway has continued
OL,9,Fconsistently and persistently since
OL,10,FAugust 2025.
OL,12,F"There is little prospect absent an
OL,13,Finjunction that it will stop."
OL,26,@nD@^OUtD@AOUuD@^O]
